WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.520
I'm gonna take a second to..

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.420
be completely open and honest with you guys.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:09.780
To be completely frank, unfiltered, this is a pure train of thought from start to finish

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.520
but it's an opportunity for me to talk to you

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.140
in a way that I haven't in...

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.000
years.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.300
I have been lying to myself

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:26.120
In a weird way, I- I've realized this, and it's not that I'm in a bad place right now,

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:30.480
I'm in a very good place. Lemme make that very clear, I'm in a great place right now.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.500
I'm at the top of my game, I have been making some incredible stuff,

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:41.740
I have the opportunity to make literally whatever I want, whenever I want.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.160
And that is an incredible feeling,

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.100
and not only do I have that, I have the skills to back it up.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.420
I've been working my ass off for six and a half years to get to this point

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:56.600
with this fire burning inside my soul to get to this point

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:01.140
where I have the skill set necessary to make great videos.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:04.800
And that is something that absolutely nobody can deny.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:10.120
I make shit videos, but I can make great videos.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:13.840
And there's a distinct difference in that, but in doing so, and in those years,

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:20.720
I have reached this conclusion, that I do not necessarily take myself at face value.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.840
And that's something that I want to change...

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:27.780
and it's not a big change, in any capacity,  it's not something that's going to be earth shattering,

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:35.120
but it is something that requires me to take the first step and the first step is telling you guys what's been missing.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:39.040
And honestly what's been missing is...this.

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:40.640
These moments.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.760
I used to all the time turn on a camera, and just absolutely, uncut, ramble.

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:51.000
100 percent let the madness inside of my mind spill out of my mouth,

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.960
into a weird string of incoherent  sentences that allows me

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.800
to express who I am.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.020
Because in a very selfish way, this channel is...me.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:09.240
It is a perfect representation of the madness inside my mind, and the ambition inside my soul.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:12.800
Everything that I am, everything that I've ever done,

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:17.360
every single emotion and nuance of the person that I not only want to be,

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:18.420
but have become,

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:22.960
is laid out bare in the videos that I have made. That is me,

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:26.180
but one thing's been missing in all of that.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:29.080
One thing's been very clearly missing, in all of that.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.000
I've been doing great videos great...

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:35.460
like... like almost short films, in terms of "Wilford Motherloving Warfstache"

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.940
I've got great plans to do even bigger and better things along the way,

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.880
but one of the things that's been missing...

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.360
is this.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:47.600
This pure, and simple unadulterated flow of thought.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:50.100
The honesty.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:51.180
The me of it.

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:52.480
The

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.620
...soul behind the channel

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.100
the...the...personality behind the person.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.600
I used to be someone that wanted to be someone else.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.460
I wanted to be Markiplier so badly, because Markiplier,

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.500
represented everything that I wanted to be.

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.560
and so Mark, took the back seat...ya know what I mean?

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:13.040
And the realization isn't that I was trying to be someone else,

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.020
I was trying to learn who I was.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.540
In six and a half years of doing this, I have lived more of my life

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:24.040
than I have in the entire 29 years of my life.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.540
This journey on YouTube has taught me more about myself than ANYTHING EVER

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.980
in the history of who I was.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.640
And a few things that I've learned about myself

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:38.140
are things that are very beneficial to what I do on YouTube.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:40.820
Number one, first and foremost, is I generally just don't give a fuck.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.760
And that's good and bad,

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:46.600
uh, when it comes down to like negativity and criticism I just don't give a fuck.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:47.920
But, in other ways, too,

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.440
on the positive side, it can allow to seem like I

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.080
just don't give a fuck.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.180
What people think, bad or good.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:04:02.860
and that's not necessarily true in-in all honesty no one will every be a bigger critic of myself than I am,

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.940
so what would someone else's opinion about me matter,

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:06.880
in the least?

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.980
But I do care, about what this channel has brought about.

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.660
Like, there's no denying that this channel

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.120
is one of the biggest, one of the most lively,

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.360
one of the best community channels

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.740
in the entire ecosystem of YouTube.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:24.140
and I'm very proud to say that I don't care if people disagree with that,

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:25.440
doesn't matter to me,

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:29.420
I'm proud of what we've accomplished on this channel.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.620
And that's not to say that everyone else is SHIT by comparison,

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.540
I'm proud of what I have done.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:37.620
but...

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:38.920
then again...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.720
I haven't had this opportunity to just talk with you guys...

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:46.000
to open up the dialogue between you. I bemoan all the time

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:51.200
like [In a fake crying voice] Ahh, I miss not being to talk to you guys on an individual level

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.380
[In his normal voice] Boo-fucking-hoo!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.620
Like, that's not what it's about.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:54.860
That's an excuse,

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:57.980
and I realize that just, like, just these past few days,

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.620
I've really been boiling up inside my mind

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:03.100
because I've been like really thinking of the different ways that I could make videos to interact

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:06.680
with people to make them members, feel like they're-they're-they're-they're...they're respected

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:08.920
a-a-and like give rewards for what they do,

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.540
and then again, not make sure that the subscribers

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.120
who you guys have been following me since the beginning feel like

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.360
you've been left behind...

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.400
I don't want that dissonance between it

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.660
and it made me realize that

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:21.400
[Almost yelling] I just haven't been talking!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:24.120
I haven't been talking to you guys!

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.240
I haven't been honest, I haven't been open,

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.640
I haven't had this dialogue that has always been so important to me

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.900
I have not spoken my mind,

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:36.560
I have not said the things that are on my heart!

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.580
The things that are weighing down on my soul!

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:45.980
I have not mentioned them, I haven't gotten emotional about my own thoughts in FOREVER!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.060
[In his normal voice] and I don't know what started that.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:49.080
I don't know what did it.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.820
I think it's almost this obsession with quality

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:55.720
of mine that has led me to not do this because in a weird way,

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.680
it seems almost juvenile to do it,

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:01.740
but it's SO important to what I am.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:04.420
To who I am. To what this channel represents.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:05.300
about me

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:09.800
It is so important that I'm able to do this fundamental thing

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:12.900
This simplistic thing that seems like bullshit,

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:14.980
but on it's surface,

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:17.540
or below it's surface, is so much more ...

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.240
This,

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.560
this right here,

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.540
is the lifeblood of this channel.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:27.600
It's what keeps it moving through the darkness

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:31.600
I've talked in the past about this fire that burns inside of you...

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.240
This fire that keeps you going through thick and thin,

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:38.640
this fire that pushes you through hardship towards your goal.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:41.140
Always moving forward,

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:43.720
and this fire catches

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:47.220
with other people when you guys have believed in me,

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:50.340
believed in what I do, in the same way that I believe that anybody

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:54.160
can accomplish their goals if they're willing to sacrifice enough

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:56.980
and it's a decision that you have to make.

00:06:56.980 --> 00:07:01.260
Is that sacrifice "worth" the chance at something better?

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:02.800
And for me the answer is always yes.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.080
Always, always yes.

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:09.580
It's why I say I wouldn't care if my channel died tomorrow.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.840
That's not to say I don't care about the channel.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:17.380
I don't care because I know, me as a person,

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:20.420
would never, EVER give up.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:25.380
And so, when I move forward, and when I came out of my slump from last year,

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.400
and I move into these bigger projects that I can do.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:31.840
It makes me realize tha-that something more....

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:33.220
is out there

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:36.680
Ya know, I used to think, that that I've reached my goals.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.420
that that I'd gotten to the point where I wanted to be.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:41.900
that I had reached the mountain top and yet I know now...

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.140
the six and half years that I've been doing this...

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:45.920
is nothing.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.760
It's absolutely nothing.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.860
You wanna know why I feel like I'm in a good place now?

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:55.340
I finally have a goal beyond what I have here.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.560
There's no denying the success of this channel.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.400
We have SOO many subscribers,

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:02.280
to the point where numbers don't even mean anything anymore,

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:03.660
but that's not what it's about.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.560
that's never been whats it's about,

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.600
and I realize that.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.640
I realize the obsession with numbers

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.500
is what's going to be the death of YouTube

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.320
and the death of any platform and the death of any creator

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.680
that gets too tied up

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:17.640
in the success of it.

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.320
The shining accolades,

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:22.040
the presents. I don't give a FUCK about awards,

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:25.020
award shows, they can all go burn, I don't care.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.980
If there's one thing in the world that doesn't mean any thing, it's opinions.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.620
opinions don't mean SHIT.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:33.280
ACTION means something.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:37.720
Taking those opinions to heart. Executing those opinions.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.040
Making those opinions happen,

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:41.040
making those ideas happen.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.500
That's what matters.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:46.260
But ideas by themselves wither and die.

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:47.220
in the darkness,

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.780
but when you take them out,

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:54.020
and you set them to flame, you can make anything happen.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:57.040
What people can make, the inspiration people take from that,

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:02.640
the ability for someone to go even farther than they ever imagined them going.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:08.240
The ability for people to push them selves beyond their means, I mean look at me...

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.620
Honestly, look at me,

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:14.660
as an example, look who I was six and a half years ago,

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:16.580
look how far I came.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:20.740
Because I made the decision to struggle every single day.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.280
Every. Single. Fucking. Day.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.860
To work towards something that I wanted

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:29.140
I didn't even know what it was that I wanted.

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:31.360
It changed all the time. What I wanted

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.060
but I knew I wanted something better

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.420
I knew I wanted to improve myself

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:40.920
I knew that there was a way to put good will, love, understanding,

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:43.060
caring into the world out there,

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.520
and I knew there was a way to do that, through a medium

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:48.740
where people could, at the same time, get joy from.

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.360
And I'm still doing it.

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:55.040
I'm still doing it to this day, and I love that.

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:58.900
I honestly, truly, 100% love that.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.900
It's my favorite thing.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.400
And it all starts here.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:08.780
I know that It can be hard to... get a read,

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.040
On who I am as a person. It's hard for me, too.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.020
I'm always changing.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:15.020
I'm always changing what I want, I'm always changing where I'm going

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.620
My priorities always change.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:17.760
But at the core of it,

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.700
what's important to me is being honest.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.440
Not just with you guys, but with myself.

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:29.680
Be honest about what I want, being open about it. Telling you guys about it.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:32.860
Making you feel like you're included in this, because you are.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:37.140
Like, you've never not been, but it didn't seem like that, you know?

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:38.320
And that's what I want to change.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:42.000
I know I'm still young, but I've never not thought about

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:45.260
What I'm going to leave behind after I die

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:47.360
I always think about that.

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:50.460
I don't fascinate- I'm not fascinated by my own death,

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.600
you know, I'm not morbid like that,

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.740
But I just recognize the idea behind it.

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:56.500
I recognize that what I do is temporary

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.080
But, what I leave behind is forever.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:04.160
Who knows what tomorrow's gonna bring, I don't know, I don't even care...

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:07.040
I've got my plans and I know there's gonna be up-ended plans

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.200
all over the place spilling out onto the road

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.020
as this train crashes down. BUT,

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:13.140
While I'm here.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.820
I'm gonna make a difference

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:19.300
And hopefully you will too.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.580
So THANK YOU everybody so much for watching

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:25.300
I do want to make more of these just talking vlogs

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:28.360
more often. I miss it. I miss you.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:30.500
So thank you for being here

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:32.400
And thank you for watching.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:37.520
And AS ALWAYS, I will see YOU, in the next video

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.520
BUH-BYE!

